  "contentHtml": "<div class=\"xiangqingchakan\"> \n <p style=\"padding:revert; max-width:100%; text-align:start\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"display: block;\"><span style=\"margin-inline: 0px;\"><span style=\"word-break: break-word;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, \"Microsoft YaHei\", Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-style: normal;\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"text-decoration-thickness: initial;\"><span style=\"text-decoration-style: initial;\"><span style=\"text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: 宋体;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; font-style: normal;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; color: black;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; background-color: white;\">  <span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">2026</span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"padding:0px; color:black\"><span style=\"padding:0px; background-color:white\">年清华大学“大学生创新训练计划”（第二批）申报项目经专家评审，批准“国家级”立项共计30项,批准“北京市级”立项共计68项，具体名单见附件1。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"padding:revert; max-width:100%; text-align:start\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"line-height:1.5\"><span style=\"display:block\"><span style=\"margin-inline:0px\"><span style=\"word-break:break-word\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑, \"Microsoft YaHei\", Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"white-space:normal\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-decoration-thickness:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-style:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-color:initial\"><span style=\"padding:0px; font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"padding:0px; color:#000000\"><span style=\"padding:0px; font-style:normal\"><span style=\"padding:0px; font-weight:400\"><span style=\"padding:0px; white-space:normal\"><span style=\"padding:0px; text-decoration:none\"><span style=\"padding:0px; color:black\"><span style=\"padding:0px; background-color:white\"><span style=\"padding: 0px;\">  探微书院申报的“基于大语言模型与PUCT启发式搜索的靶向多肽优化智能体构建与验证”和iCenter申报的“星际算力：太空AI数据中心效能验证系统开发”获得重点支持领域项目立项。第一批立项的创业项目中有3个创业项目经过答辩认定为国家级项目。具体名单见附件1。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"padding:revert; max-width:100%; text-align:start\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"line-height:1.5\"><span style=\"display:block\"><span style=\"margin-inline:0px\"><span style=\"word-break:break-word\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑, \"Microsoft YaHei\", Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"white-space:normal\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-decoration-thickness:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-style:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-color:initial\"><span style=\"padding:0px; font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"padding:0px; color:#000000\"><span style=\"padding:0px; font-style:normal\"><span style=\"padding:0px; font-weight:400\"><span style=\"padding:0px; white-space:normal\"><span style=\"padding:0px; text-decoration:none\"><span style=\"padding:0px; color:black\"><span style=\"padding:0px; background-color:white\"><span style=\"padding: 0px;\">  本批项目从公布之日起正式启动，项目经费将于近日下拨。项目经费一概下拨至指导教师，因此院系经费中可能也会有通过三创教育平台、校团委或者书院立项的项目。经费明细将通过办公邮件发至各院系教学办，请各院系本科教务老师注意查收、转发给指导教师（及立项同学）并组织项目工作。项目执行时间为一年，请各项目负责人和指导教师掌握进度，及时完成项目目标，并于2027年5月提交结题报告。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"padding:revert; max-width:100%; text-align:start\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"line-height:1.5\"><span style=\"display:block\"><span style=\"margin-inline:0px\"><span style=\"word-break:break-word\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑, \"Microsoft YaHei\", Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"white-space:normal\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-decoration-thickness:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-style:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-color:initial\"><span style=\"padding:0px; font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"padding:0px; color:#000000\"><span style=\"padding:0px; font-style:normal\"><span style=\"padding:0px; font-weight:400\"><span style=\"padding:0px; white-space:normal\"><span style=\"padding:0px; text-decoration:none\"><span style=\"padding:0px; color:black\"><span style=\"padding:0px; background-color:white\"><span style=\"padding: 0px;\">  按照教育部建立大创项目国家级、市级、校级三级管理体系的要求，将SRT学生立项项目列入大创计划校级项目，双轨管理、教育部备案，项目管理、执行规则和流程仍按SRT项目管理。2026年清华大学“大学生创新训练计划”校级立项项目清单见附件2。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"padding:revert; max-width:100%; text-align:start\"> </p> \n <p style=\"padding:revert; max-width:100%; text-align:start\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"line-height:1.5\"><span style=\"display:block\"><span style=\"margin-inline:0px\"><span style=\"word-break:break-word\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑, \"Microsoft YaHei\", Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"white-space:normal\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-decoration-thickness:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-style:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-color:initial\"><span style=\"padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"padding:0px; font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"padding:0px; color:#000000\"><span style=\"padding:0px; font-style:normal\"><span style=\"padding:0px; font-weight:400\"><span style=\"padding:0px; white-space:normal\"><span style=\"padding:0px; text-decoration:none\"><span style=\"padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"padding:0px; color:black\"><span style=\"padding:0px; background-color:white\">  联系人：郑琳 62785575</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"padding:revert; max-width:100%; text-align:start\"> </p> \n <p style=\"padding: revert; max-width: 100%; text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"line-height:1.5\"><span style=\"display:block\"><span style=\"margin-inline:0px\"><span style=\"word-break:break-word\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑, \"Microsoft YaHei\", Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"white-space:normal\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-decoration-thickness:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-style:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-color:initial\"><span style=\"padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"padding:0px; font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"padding:0px; color:#000000\"><span style=\"padding:0px; font-style:normal\"><span style=\"padding:0px; font-weight:400\"><span style=\"padding:0px; white-space:normal\"><span style=\"padding:0px; text-decoration:none\"><span style=\"padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"padding:0px; color:black\"><span style=\"padding:0px; background-color:white\">教务处实践办公室</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"padding: revert; max-width: 100%; text-align: right;\"> </p> \n <p style=\"padding: revert; max-width: 100%; text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"line-height:1.5\"><span style=\"display:block\"><span style=\"margin-inline:0px\"><span style=\"word-break:break-word\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑, \"Microsoft YaHei\", Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"white-space:normal\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-decoration-thickness:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-style:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-color:initial\"><span style=\"padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"padding:0px; font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"padding:0px; color:#000000\"><span style=\"padding:0px; font-style:normal\"><span style=\"padding:0px; font-weight:400\"><span style=\"padding:0px; white-space:normal\"><span style=\"padding:0px; text-decoration:none\"><span style=\"padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"padding:0px; color:black\"><span style=\"padding:0px; background-color:white\">2026</span></span></span><span style=\"padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"padding:0px; color:black\"><span style=\"padding:0px; background-color:white\">年6月30日</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n</div>",
  "contentText": "2026 年清华大学“大学生创新训练计划”（第二批）申报项目经专家评审，批准“国家级”立项共计30项,批准“北京市级”立项共计68项，具体名单见附件1。 探微书院申报的“基于大语言模型与PUCT启发式搜索的靶向多肽优化智能体构建与验证”和iCenter申报的“星际算力：太空AI数据中心效能验证系统开发”获得重点支持领域项目立项。第一批立项的创业项目中有3个创业项目经过答辩认定为国家级项目。具体名单见附件1。 本批项目从公布之日起正式启动，项目经费将于近日下拨。项目经费一概下拨至指导教师，因此院系经费中可能也会有通过三创教育平台、校团委或者书院立项的项目。经费明细将通过办公邮件发至各院系教学办，请各院系本科教务老师注意查收、转发给指导教师（及立项同学）并组织项目工作。项目执行时间为一年，请各项目负责人和指导教师掌握进度，及时完成项目目标，并于2027年5月提交结题报告。 按照教育部建立大创项目国家级、市级、校级三级管理体系的要求，将SRT学生立项项目列入大创计划校级项目，双轨管理、教育部备案，项目管理、执行规则和流程仍按SRT项目管理。2026年清华大学“大学生创新训练计划”校级立项项目清单见附件2。 联系人：郑琳 62785575 教务处实践办公室 2026 年6月30日",
